# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  DISABLED — kept for reference only.
#
#  This workflow used to deploy the frontend to GitHub Pages on every push to
#  main. It is incompatible with the Azure Static Web Apps deploy
#  (.github/workflows/deploy-azure.yml) because:
#
#    1. Two simultaneous deploys cause race conditions in the `dist/` artifact.
#    2. GitHub Pages cannot serve the Azure Functions API (/api/*) — the
#       Daraja and AI proxy endpoints would 404 on the Pages mirror.
#    3. CSP headers from staticwebapp.config.json are not honoured by Pages.
#
#  The Azure deploy is the single source of truth. If you need a static-only
#  preview again, restore this file (rename → .yml) AND remove deploy-azure.yml.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
